# Vendored read-only reference copies of sibling-repo files (see .claude/plans).
# Mirrored locally so plan references resolve without a specific checkout layout.
cauldron/

# Compiled monitor binary — `go build ./cmd/iscc-monitor` emits it at the repo
# root (and in the command dir); never commit the 15MB artifact.
/iscc-monitor
/cmd/iscc-monitor/iscc-monitor

# Local secrets / state — never commit (public-repo safety).
.env
.env.*
.claude/settings.local.json
**/auth.json
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
